Package: arc-dgpu-ctl
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, kmod, udev
Description: runtime power-off for Intel Arc (Alchemist) discrete GPUs
 Unbinds the HDA audio companion and i915/xe from an Intel Arc Alchemist
 (DG2) GPU in a safe order and removes it from the PCI bus so the PCIe root
 port can reach D3cold, then restores it at runtime without a reboot.
 .
 Supports the mobile Arc A-series, and desktop A380/A580/A750/A770 when the
 displays are driven by the integrated GPU. The boot-time service is shipped
 disabled.
